WEBVTT

00:38:00.279 --> 00:38:03.366
and probably one of the worst
days of my life

00:38:03.390 --> 00:38:06.906
was January 8, 2011.

00:38:06.930 --> 00:38:09.296
I was on the space station

00:38:09.320 --> 00:38:13.646
about halfway through
my six-month mission,

00:38:13.670 --> 00:38:17.466
and I get a call from
the control center in Houston,

00:38:17.490 --> 00:38:18.910
and then they say,

00:38:18.934 --> 00:38:22.692
"Scott, I don't know how to tell you this,
so I'm just going to tell you.

00:38:22.716 --> 00:38:26.838
Your sister-in-law Gabby was shot

00:38:26.862 --> 00:38:28.956
in Tucson, Arizona."

00:38:28.980 --> 00:38:32.186
And I quickly got on the phone
with my brother.